  "metadata": {
    "name": "Creative Commons Hero (port)",
    "description": "Creative Commons Hero was released in 2021 as a custom setlist for Clone Hero with full-difficulty guitar and drums, created in collaboration by Gigakoops and Nightmare Lyra. All of the songs in this setlist can be found on Creative Commons sources around the internet, including Free Music Archive, Jamendo, and Bandcamp. Now, 5 years later, the setlist has been ported to YARG! Though a number of songs were omitted (mostly due to no-derivatives licenses), we are glad to have 70 charts from the setlist available to download and enjoy.",
    "iconUrl": "https://releases.yarg.in/profiles/46a398b7-1902-40f9-93b6-fe2f8216b79a/icon.png",
